  "statement": "# The Ember Key — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nExplore a top-down dungeon, learn what each locked route demands, survive threats, obtain what opens the way, and escape.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact top-down action-adventure with exploration, gated progression, readable danger, failure/recovery, and a final escape state.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may design the floor layout, key or relic rules, enemy mix, and order of discoveries.\n"
